ey are given nothing","comment":"It depends (the user, 9 Oct 2026: \"Dependant\", \"It''ll be dynamic you know\"): on the lender''s temper, on what there is aboard to take, on whether she has just made fools of them, and on how often she has paid nothing.","color":{"r":0.32,"g":0.55,"b":0.32,"a":1.0},"guid":"d4cb6c97-97c0-40fe-884b-6700ea4a5336","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":2900.0,"yMin":760.0,"xMax":3780.0,"yMax":1020.0},"title":"The answer","body":"0  they only talk, and go home.\n1  they take what they came for: silver first, then cargo for the rest.\n2  they take, and beat a man.\n3  they take, and kill a man.\n4  they take, and kill Ravn.\nWhat they take is another rule (Rule - what the lender''s men come for).","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"b72db091-17cb-48f3-9054-3e8a2a4505f1","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-20.0,"yMin":1000.0,"xMax":440.0,"yMax":1130.0},"title":"Where the numbers come from","body":"warnUpTo, beatFrom, killFrom, killEarly and ravnAtRefusal in Game/Data/collectors_793.json. The throw is the game''s own, one for each sending.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"17c36c66-3db7-44d4-a659-9a61afd44c04","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}}'
